2026-11-25T09:09:31.3469915Z   ok   an unconfigured input is not a problem
2026-11-25T09:09:31.3470253Z   ok   a non-numeric state does not raise
2026-11-25T09:09:31.3470638Z   ok   a non-finite state string is refused exactly like a word
2026-11-25T09:09:31.3471087Z   ok   a non-finite value is refused after unit conversion too
