2026-11-25T09:09:31.4387724Z -- v4.0.5 — DHW conservation: a cold tank cannot pour hot water
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4388008Z   ok   the booked draw never exceeds the nominal demand
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4388250Z   ok   every step balances: in == out + losses + storage delta
