2026-11-25T09:09:31.4389420Z   ok   a tank at the setpoint is debited exactly the nominal draw
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4389843Z   ok   charging cannot pass the tank rating, and the excess is booked
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4390192Z   ok   a tank read above the rating cools at its physical rate, not by fiat
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4390499Z   ok   an inlet above the tank's surroundings manufactures no heat over 24 h
2026-11-25T09:09:31.4390769Z   ok   the tank is not pinned at the inlet: it settles toward its surroundings
